<title>UK: IPAI production data.</title>
<headline>IPAI production data.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) March production data due to be issued later on Monday will not include figures for China.</p>
<p>However, the data for February in the report will still include the statistics for China that were issued previously.</p>
<p>Also, aggregate data for 1997 will still include figures for China.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
